From 738d8412f0f6d39a4c2c824b3bcbd2ec75ece31f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Broyojo <dha@xoba.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 09:40:41 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] shortcuts: Give a game's shortcut its icon when it is
 installed

Steam's shortcut for a game in ~/Applications carries Steam's own icon when
the game has no Mac icon. Run Hadron's scripts/shortcut-icon, which puts the
game's icon there, when the client starts and when Steam adds a shortcut or
an application manifest, and every 30 seconds while a game with a shortcut
is still being installed. Only the listings of ~/Applications and of each
library's steamapps directory are watched, so what a running game writes
below them wakes nothing.
---
